OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA grey and
OL,6,Fwet start to the night, drier spells
OL,7,Fcan be expected during the second half
OL,8,Fof the night with some clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping by Wednesday morning. Winds
OL,10,Feasing slightly. Feeling chillier in
OL,11,Frural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FDry for most places with
OL,14,Fclear spells to start the day. Turning
OL,15,Funsettled with persistent and heavy
OL,16,Frain for some in the afternoon.
OL,17,FBecoming windy into the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
