OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fmix of dry spells and stormy
OL,7,Fconditions to end the week. Heavy
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain with strong and
OL,9,Fgusty winds to be expected on Friday
OL,10,Fand late Saturday.
